<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="gu">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>I Love Janudi</title>

<style>
body{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff0080,#ffcc00,#00c3ff);
    font-family:cursive;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.text{
    text-align:center;
    animation:zoom 2s infinite alternate;
}

h1{
    font-size:60px;
    color:white;
    text-shadow:0 0 10px red,
                 0 0 20px yellow,
                 0 0 30px pink;
}

p{
    font-size:35px;
    color:#fff;
    text-shadow:0 0 10px blue,
                 0 0 20px purple;
}

@keyframes zoom{
    from{
        transform:scale(1);
    }
    to{
        transform:scale(1.1);
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="text">
    <h1>❤️ I LOVE JANUDI ❤️</h1>
    <p>તું મારી દુનિયા છે ✨</p>
    <p>હંમેશા તને પ્રેમ કરું છું 💖</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>